I've returned Zhou Ru to Chu

283
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:31,630
and erased her memories of you.

284
00:20:32,600 --> 00:20:34,670
That way, she may live a full life.

285
00:20:35,800 --> 00:20:36,830
Wan'er,

286
00:20:37,520 --> 00:20:39,520
you waited 300 years for me.

287
00:20:40,360 --> 00:20:42,110
I, Wang Lin, can never repay you.

288
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:44,230
But I will do my utmost.

289
00:20:45,360 --> 00:20:46,430
One year,

290
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:48,030
ten years,

291
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:49,070
a hundred years,

292
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:49,950
a thousand years !

293
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:53,040
Until the end of my life

294
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:54,390
when my soul scatters.

295
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:58,590
I will try the miracle of awakening you.

296
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:08,950
Wan'er...

297
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:15,280
Wait for me.

298
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:31,710
Only by becoming stronger than I am today

299
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:36,080
will I be able to protect the people that are important to me.

300
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:39,030
Now that I am half a step into Soul Transformation,

301
00:21:39,760 --> 00:21:41,790
I must return to planet Suzaku

302
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:44,750
and breakthrough to Soul Transformation !

303
00:21:51,230 --> 00:24:27,470
The adaptation doesn't really emphasize Wang Lin's confusion about the messenger of the law of the heavens. The heavens should be etheral and shouldn't need to have a messenger. Also this messenger is supposedly a 7-star Ancient God but doesn't display the strength of one which confuses Wang Lin even more.\NWang Lin's "victory" can be attributed to the fact that he understood that he was facing a fake law of the heavens which can be defied by the Heaven Defying Bead.\N\N“Without my permission, forget the fact that you aren’t even the real law of the heavens, but even if you were, don’t think you can take her away !”\NThe heaven’s messenger shot a thoughtful look at Wang Lin. His eyes were filled with confusion. Then his body slowly disappeared, and in the blink of an eye, the clouds and the wheel also disappeared.\N\NIn a way, without ever wanting to, Wang Lin used Li Muwan as his cultivation furnace to cultivate the Life and Death Domain to completion.\N\NI invite you to reread the note of episode 72 if you don't remember it. See a mountain as a mountain and water as water...

304
00:22:08,410 --> 00:22:11,710
To let go of the consequences of my actions

305
00:22:11,710 --> 00:22:13,430
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

306
00:22:13,470 --> 00:22:15,370
like scattered ink.

307
00:22:16,250 --> 00:22:22,850
As destiny falls

308
00:22:19,090 --> 00:22:22,850
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

309
00:22:22,850 --> 00:22:30,450
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

310
00:22:26,090 --> 00:22:30,450
wither and melt into rivers.

311
00:22:30,890 --> 00:22:38,010
Who can deceive

312
00:22:33,650 --> 00:22:38,010
the law of the heavens ?

313
00:22:38,330 --> 00:22:41,330
Countless generations

314
00:22:39,610 --> 00:22:41,330
have tried before me.

315
00:22:41,620 --> 00:22:45,050
But how could I not catch my dreams

316
00:22:43,450 --> 00:22:45,050
within my warm fingers ?

317
00:22:45,610 --> 00:22:49,130
You're at my side when I'm alone

318
00:22:49,130 --> 00:22:52,450
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

319
00:22:53,210 --> 00:22:56,410
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

320
00:22:56,770 --> 00:23:00,610
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

321
00:22:58,610 --> 00:23:00,610
in the streets.

322
00:23:00,770 --> 00:23:05,570
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

323
00:23:02,330 --> 00:23:05,570
Can I break the rules ?

324
00:23:05,580 --> 00:23:08,290
To run towards you !

325
00:23:08,330 --> 00:23:11,610
I will fight the will of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

326
00:23:11,610 --> 00:23:16,250
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

327
00:23:16,250 --> 00:23:19,650
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

328
00:23:19,690 --> 00:23:24,330
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

329
00:23:24,780 --> 00:23:30,010
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

330
00:23:30,130 --> 00:23:33,930
If your soul is willing to wander,

331
00:23:33,930 --> 00:23:38,570
can I still take your hands

332
00:23:35,610 --> 00:23:38,570
and hold them tight ?

333
00:23:38,730 --> 00:23:41,650
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

334
00:23:41,650 --> 00:23:46,530
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

335
00:23:46,540 --> 00:23:49,810
I dream of destroying

336
00:23:49,970 --> 00:23:54,530
the shackles of our fate.

337
00:23:54,530 --> 00:23:58,490
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

338
00:23:58,490 --> 00:24:01,290
You're the hardest to let go of.

339
00:24:01,370 --> 00:24:05,170
I want to be with you again

340
00:24:05,250 --> 00:24:08,530
so I can look in your eyes.

341
00:24:08,810 --> 00:24:13,770
Even for a moment, it's worth it.

342
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:38,280
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.

343
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:44,400
Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.

344
00:16:44,710 --> 00:16:48,640
Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls

345
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:52,600
and like many other unseparable things.

346
00:16:52,830 --> 00:16:58,560
In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

347
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:05,490
Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

348
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:11,340
Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.

349
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:16,920
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul

350
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:20,440
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

351
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:26,640
Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.

352
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:30,560
The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.

353
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:34,480
Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.

354
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:40,320
Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.

355
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:44,240
One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

356
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:48,040
One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

357
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:54,120
Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.

358
00:17:55,440 --> 00:18:01,140
I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.

359
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:07,960
Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
